Reusable recording core: bufferedWriter/

Read bufferedWriter/src/bufferedWriter.h for ownership and concurrency rules.
The library owns the ring and writes bytes through byteSink. It has no ADC,
Feather, SD wiring, filesystem, sample encoding, or FreeRTOS dependency.

Project integration and the reading guide live in ../src/backend/.
Desktop failure/wraparound tests live in ../test/writerChecks.cpp.
